<title>USA: TENNIS-MEMPHIS MEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-MEMPHIS MEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MEMPHIS, Tennessee 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the</p>
<p>$825,000 St Jude men's tennis tournament on Wednesday (prefix</p>
<p>number denote seeding)</p>
<p>Second round</p>
<p>Gustavo Kuerten (Brazil) beat 2-Andre Agassi (U.S.) 6-2 6-4</p>
<p>3-Todd Martin (U.S.) beat Bryan Shelton (U.S.) 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>Javier Frana (Argentina) beat 4-MaliVai Washington (U.S.) 7-6</p>
<p>(10-8) 6-3</p>
<p>5-Paul Haarhuis (the Netherlands) beat Justin Gimelstob</p>
<p>(U.S.) 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>7-Richey Reneberg (U.S.) beat Juan Albert Viloca (Spain) 6-3</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>Sargis Sargsian (Armenia) beat 9-Alex O'Brien (U.S.) 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>12-Chris Woodruff (U.S.) beat Scott Draper (Australia) 4-6</p>
<p>6-2 6-1</p>
<p>13-Jonas Bjorkman (Sweden) beat Richard Fromberg (Australia)</p>
<p>6-4 6-3</p>
<p>Guillaume Raoux (France) beat 14-Mark Woodforde (Australia)</p>
<p>7-5 5-7 6-4</p>
<p>Jeff Tarango (U.S.) beat 16-Vince Spadea (U.S.) 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>Brett Steven (New Zealand) beat Nicolas Lapentti (Ecuador)</p>
<p>7-6 (7-2) 6-4</p>
<p>Alex Radulescu (Germany) beat 6-Jason Stoltenberg (Australia)</p>
<p>6-3 6-2</p>
</text>
